#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:7
#: b95b46303be249f3992f1832605d09ba
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:9
#: 8f2e4f4918b643ffb75f95bbb09e73fc
msgid ""
"按规则表对指定元素原子做删除操作，生成可控的空位缺陷结构。每条规则精确控制\"删除什么元素、删多少个、在哪个 region 删\"，支持元素过滤和"
" group 区域约束。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:11
#: dba77503d4fe413b91b8ea942daceb9e
msgid "**和 `Vacancy Defect Generation` 的区别：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:12
#: 727096fe237b4ea0ad585bc9e446551a
msgid "`Random Vacancy`：规则驱动，按元素+group 精确删除位点，适合定向研究某类空位缺陷"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:13
#: d5ec9bba7e1d4a4eb43ee7440cc2c744
msgid "`Vacancy Defect Generation`：统计驱动，按整体浓度或数量随机删除，适合快速生成低/中/高缺陷强度的分布样本"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:15
#: c40852ae76d5429cbf0422470897d22c
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:17
#: 0076c59c9d2b49c7ab9cb29b9445ed86
msgid "场景：模型对表面氧空位预测完全错误"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:19
#: e8868c358dc540e89dc673c65716feb7
msgid ""
"你在 LiCoO2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，体相性质预测很好，但一跑表面 slab 加氧空位的构型，能量误差是体相的 3 "
"倍。检查发现训练集里没有缺氧的结构，模型根本不知道氧空位附近 Co 原子的局域环境长什么样。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:21
#: 82744443cca24affa7c6ae0697160c1c
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** 氧空位周围，Co 原子从正常的 Co-O "
"八面体配位变成五配位甚至四配位，键长、电荷分布都变了。训练集里只有完美晶体结构，模型完全靠外推处理这些配位变化。需要往训练集中加入精确控制的氧空位构型，让模型见过\"氧被拿走\"之后的配位环境。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:23
#: 1d3c17c7e55c469895a140bc72cad3da
msgid "**输入：** 一个 LiCoO2 的 slab 结构，已经用 `Group Label` 标记了表面层和体相的 group"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:25
#: 8c34f23646e64cc2ade359446a0a68fe
msgid "**目标：** 只删表面层的氧原子，每次删 1~3 个，每帧生成 20 个不同落点的空位版本"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:27
#: e1a59ae2faaa4ecbbbd9c68a934e4436
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:28
#: 50aa4d1e5dac4812b7b44aa1c8045e8e
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`Rules`：`[{\"element\":\"O\",\"count\":[1,3],\"group\":[\"surface\"]}]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:29
#: 376f3d19a0d847478820d88a639db80f
msgid "`Structures`：`[20]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:30
#: 019b320011cc493998340f92fef34bf8
msgid "`Use Seed`：勾选，`Seed`：`[42]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/random-vacancy-card.md:32
#: c99e3de6e60e4669b1404213b8b3ae4d
msgid "**输出：** 20 个空位结构，每帧中 1~3 个表面氧被删除，带 `Vac(n=...)` 标签"
msgstr ""

